        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Ultimate Ragdoll Playground!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> Please turn off upscaling on your GPU as this can currently mess with the physics<br><br>From the mind of a developer who loves the chaotic fun of ragdolls and the endless possibilities of physics, Ragdoll Mayhem Maker is the ultimate 2D sandbox for creators and players alike. Whether you want to test your skills on dozens of handcrafted levels or build the level of your dreams (or nightmares!), the only limit is your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Two Ways to Play: Solve or Create!</strong> <strong></strong><br><br><br>Jump right into <strong>Play Mode</strong> and tackle over 30 unique, pre-built levels designed to challenge your understanding of physics and timing. Or, unleash your inner game designer in the powerful and easy-to-use <strong>Level Editor</strong>, where you can build anything you can think of and share it with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hilarious Ragdoll Physics:</i></strong><i> Our ragdoll is designed to tumble, flip, and flail in the most entertaining ways. Every fall is a new funny moment.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Level Editor:</strong> With a simple, JSON-based system, you can place objects, set their properties, and create complex contraptions with ease. If you can dream it, you can build it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>30 Handcrafted Levels:</i></strong><i> Test your skills on a growing list of official levels that range from simple puzzles to devious challenges. With more levels to come.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pinball Mayhem:</strong> We've just added a suite of pinball parts! Build your own fully functional, ragdoll-based pinball tables with flippers, bumpers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> With the ability to build, share, and download new levels, the fun never has to stop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Early Access?</strong><br>&quot;Ragdoll Mayhem Maker is a game built for a community. Your feedback is crucial as I expand the sandbox with new items, traps, and features. The current version is fully playable with a robust level editor and 30 official levels, but this is just the beginning. By joining now, you can directly influence the development of the game and help grow it into something truly special.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Roadmap Includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dozens of new level parts and objects.</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>New game modes and challenges.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More official levels based on community feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A separate drag and drop level editor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community  and start building the chaos today!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Ultimate Ragdoll Playground!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong> Please turn off upscaling on your GPU as this can currently mess with the physics<br><br>From the mind of a developer who loves the chaotic fun of ragdolls and the endless possibilities of physics, Ragdoll Mayhem Maker is the ultimate 2D sandbox for creators and players alike. Whether you want to test your skills on dozens of handcrafted levels or build the level of your dreams (or nightmares!), the only limit is your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Two Ways to Play: Solve or Create!</strong> <strong></strong><br><br><br>Jump right into <strong>Play Mode</strong> and tackle over 30 unique, pre-built levels designed to challenge your understanding of physics and timing. Or, unleash your inner game designer in the powerful and easy-to-use <strong>Level Editor</strong>, where you can build anything you can think of and share it with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hilarious Ragdoll Physics:</i></strong><i> Our ragdoll is designed to tumble, flip, and flail in the most entertaining ways. Every fall is a new funny moment.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Level Editor:</strong> With a simple, JSON-based system, you can place objects, set their properties, and create complex contraptions with ease. If you can dream it, you can build it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>30 Handcrafted Levels:</i></strong><i> Test your skills on a growing list of official levels that range from simple puzzles to devious challenges. With more levels to come.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pinball Mayhem:</strong> We've just added a suite of pinball parts! Build your own fully functional, ragdoll-based pinball tables with flippers, bumpers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> With the ability to build, share, and download new levels, the fun never has to stop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Early Access?</strong><br>&quot;Ragdoll Mayhem Maker is a game built for a community. Your feedback is crucial as I expand the sandbox with new items, traps, and features. The current version is fully playable with a robust level editor and 30 official levels, but this is just the beginning. By joining now, you can directly influence the development of the game and help grow it into something truly special.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Roadmap Includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dozens of new level parts and objects.</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>New game modes and challenges.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More official levels based on community feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A separate drag and drop level editor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community  and start building the chaos today!</p>",
        "short_description": "I love ragdolls and I love physics, so I thought I would mush the two together with a level editor and make a cool sandbox game for people to play around in. Currently, there is a very basic JSON-based level editor and 20 pre-built levels.",
